{
    "title": "Car Parking Jam 3D: Move it!",
    "description": "With this parking games, you need to master your car driving skills to move all stuck cars out of the parking lot. \r\n<i>We like to move it, move it. Ya like to.. Move it! Let's move some cars!<i>\r\n\r\nTo become a <b>Parking Jam 3D Legend<b>, \r\n> Think strategically\r\n> Driving cars to move it\r\n> Use your moves wisely as they are very limited in some hard-mode parking jam puzzles \r\n> Master all the parking jam nerve-cracking challenges \r\n> Watch the magic happen when all car finds their way out of the parking jam.\r\n\r\nEvery parking jam area needs a parking king and we can't wait for you to destroy this car parking games!\r\n\r\nThere are a lot of Parking Games in store, so what's hot about Car Parking Jam 3D: Move it!\r\n> STRESS RELEASE. Enjoy the satisfaction of driving cars out of the annoying parking lot or just hitting the cars without being filed a claim or paying for repairs!\r\n> HUNDREDS LEVEL GAMES which get harder every time and require overview skills and critical thinking to be beaten. Our parking games update the latest traffic jam puzzles every day just for you.\r\n\r\nTry the car parking games now and become the ultimate king of Car Parking Jam 3D!</b></b></i></i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "With this parking games, you need to master your car driving skills to move all stuck cars out of the parking lot. <br><i>We like to move it, move it. Ya like to.. Move it! Let&#39;s move some cars!<i><br><br>To become a <b>Parking Jam 3D Legend<b>, <br>&gt; Think strategically<br>&gt; Driving cars to move it<br>&gt; Use your moves wisely as they are very limited in some hard-mode parking jam puzzles <br>&gt; Master all the parking jam nerve-cracking challenges <br>&gt; Watch the magic happen when all car finds their way out of the parking jam.<br><br>Every parking jam area needs a parking king and we can&#39;t wait for you to destroy this car parking games!<br><br>There are a lot of Parking Games in store, so what&#39;s hot about Car Parking Jam 3D: Move it!<br>&gt; STRESS RELEASE. Enjoy the satisfaction of driving cars out of the annoying parking lot or just hitting the cars without being filed a claim or paying for repairs!<br>&gt; HUNDREDS LEVEL GAMES which get harder every time and require overview skills and critical thinking to be beaten. Our parking games update the latest traffic jam puzzles every day just for you.<br><br>Try the car parking games now and become the ultimate king of Car Parking Jam 3D!</b></b></i></i>",
